---
description: Required task-scoped implementation, repository-memory, and validation workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing code, read `AGENTS.md`.

For every implementation task:

1. Run `npm run agent:task -- --task "<user request>"`.
2. Read `.autoreview/reports/task-context.md` and listed `.agent-memory` files (`npm run agent:context`).
3. Implement only the requested change.
4. Run `npm run review:run` (fast mode — default).
5. Fix critical and high-confidence scoped failures.
6. Re-run affected checks via `review:run` again as needed.
7. Run `npm run agent:finish`.
8. Read `.autoreview/reports/latest.md`.
9. Include an evidence summary in the final response (Implemented / Verified / Skipped / Remaining / Report / Final status).

Do not run thorough or cross-browser checks unless explicitly requested.

Do not inspect unrelated routes or the full site.

Do not claim completion when required quality gates fail or the report is stale.

Do not answer only “done”, “implemented”, or “tests pass”.
